{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fire.gif?t=1745420524\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcane Tower Survivors is a horde survival game where you face relentless waves of enemies in intense 20-minute sessions, with over 100 unique skills to help you fend off the onslaught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>Make different builds that are unique each game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/crosses.gif?t=1745420524\" />Rebuild abandoned wizard tower to get more abilities, characters and weapons.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/tower.gif?t=1745420524\" /><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extensive Skill System</strong>: Discover and master more than 100 character skills, allowing for limitless build combinations and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Heroes and Weapons</strong>: Choose from a wide array of heroes and weaponry, each offering unique abilities and playstyles to keep each run fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Tower Management</strong>: Engage in a deep meta-game between battles. Build and upgrade your tower to gain passive bonuses, unlock new content, and strengthen your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Sessions</strong>: Experience intense action in 20-minute runs designed for quick yet satisfying gameplay sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progressive Enhancement</strong>: Benefit from a passive progression system where each run contributes to your overall power, encouraging continual growth and new tactical opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/light.gif?t=1745420524\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight engaging bosses that will keep you on your toes and offer great rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/Steam_boss_eye2.gif?t=1745420524\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2433850?t=1745420524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2433850?t=1745420524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/7fcc5085862e8bf39893ef7fbacf4d4f0896ce24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745420524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/7fcc5085862e8bf39893ef7fbacf4d4f0896ce24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745420524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fire.gif?t=1745420524\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcane Tower Survivors is a horde survival game where you face relentless waves of enemies in intense 20-minute sessions, with over 100 unique skills to help you fend off the onslaught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>Make different builds that are unique each game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/crosses.gif?t=1745420524\" />Rebuild abandoned wizard tower to get more abilities, characters and weapons.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/tower.gif?t=1745420524\" /><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extensive Skill System</strong>: Discover and master more than 100 character skills, allowing for limitless build combinations and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Heroes and Weapons</strong>: Choose from a wide array of heroes and weaponry, each offering unique abilities and playstyles to keep each run fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Tower Management</strong>: Engage in a deep meta-game between battles. Build and upgrade your tower to gain passive bonuses, unlock new content, and strengthen your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Sessions</strong>: Experience intense action in 20-minute runs designed for quick yet satisfying gameplay sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progressive Enhancement</strong>: Benefit from a passive progression system where each run contributes to your overall power, encouraging continual growth and new tactical opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/light.gif?t=1745420524\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight engaging bosses that will keep you on your toes and offer great rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/Steam_boss_eye2.gif?t=1745420524\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Red Horde Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/00208239723c5897d3044f3dff4cdb84795b1f3c/header.jpg?t=1745420524","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":